    "text": "Eadwerdes ger\u00e6nesse.\nEadwerd cyning byt \u00f0am gerefum eallum, \u00f0\u00e6t ge deman swa rihte domas swa ge rihtoste cunnon, & hit\nNe wandia\u00f0 for nanum \u00f0ingum folcriht to geregceanne; & \u00f0\u00e6t gehwilc spr\u00e6ce habbe andagan,\n& ic wille, \u00f0\u00e6t gehwilc man h\u00e6bbe his geteaman; & nan man ne ceapige butan porte, ac h\u00e6bbe \u00fe\u00e6s\n& gif hwa butan porte ceapige, \u00f0onne sy he cyninges oferhyrnesse scyldig; & gange se team \u00feeah for\u00f0,\nEac we cw\u00e6don: se \u00f0e tyman scolde, \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6fde ungeligene gewitnesse \u00f0\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6t he hit on riht\nSwa we cw\u00e6don be \u00fe\u00e6re agnunge \u00f0\u00e6t ylce, \u00fe\u00e6t he gel\u00e6dde ungeligene gewitnesse \u00f0\u00e6s, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00f0one a\u00fe\nGif he \u00f0onne ne mehte, \u00f0onne namede him man VI men on \u00f0am ylcan geburhscipe, \u00fee he on hamf\u00e6st\nEac we cw\u00e6don: gif enig yfelra manna w\u00e6re \u00f0e wolde o\u00f0res yrfe to borge settan for wi\u00f0ertihtlan, \u00f0\u00e6t\nEac we cw\u00e6don, hw\u00e6s se wyr\u00f0e w\u00e6re \u00fee o\u00f0rum ryhtes wyrnde a\u00f0or o\u00f0\u00f0e on boclande o\u00f0\u00f0e on\nGif he \u00f0onne nan riht n\u00e6fde ne on boclande ne on folclande, \u00fe\u00e6t se w\u00e6re \u00fee rihtes wyrnde scyldig\nEac we cw\u00e6don be \u00feam mannum \u00f0e mansworan w\u00e6ran, gif \u00f0\u00e6t geswutelod w\u00e6re, o\u00f0\u00f0e him a\u00f0 burste",
